-[F2] If $A=\begin{pmatrix}a&b\\c&d\end{pmatrix}\in SL_2(\mathbb C)$, then $A^{-1}=\begin{pmatrix}d&-b\\-c&a\end{pmatrix}$, an integer-polynomial expression in its entries ([[def-sl-two-character-variety-and-peripheral-eigenvalues]]).
